    "name": "vortex_stake",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Vortexes stake: one stake pool per DAO per token. Members stake once; every governance model the DAO switches to reads voting power from the same pool, and a token change opens a new pool while the old one keeps paying out."
